    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibition of application lapse due to inaccurate or misleading information" ;
    cml:premiseText "(9) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, determine a form of information for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(e)(ii)." ;
    cml:conclusionText "If an application made under subsection 26BD(1) has passed preliminary assessment, the application lapses if: (a) the application contains information that is inaccurate or misleading in a material particular; or (b) information given to the Secretary by, or on behalf of, the applicant in connection with the application is inaccurate or misleading in a material particular; or (c) the evaluation fee prescribed for the purposes of paragraph 26BE(3)(b) has not been paid before the end of the period worked out in accordance with the regulations." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .


